## DUAL-LICENSE BUSINESS MODEL

MedusaServ Professional Web Server operates under a **dual-license model** to achieve financial independence:

### FREE TIER (Ad-Supported License)

**Cost:** Free
**Features:** Full software functionality with integrated advertisements

**Terms:**
- ✅ Complete access to **ALL features** (no feature restrictions)
- ✅ FREE SSL certificates (Let's Encrypt integration)
- ✅ FCCP 10Gbps+ file transfers
- ✅ IceWall quantum-resistant firewall
- ✅ PsiForceDB with PFQL
- ✅ All thingamabobs available
- ⚠️ Advertisements are **MANDATORY** and built into the software
- ❌ Users may **NOT** attempt to remove, block, or disable advertisements
- ❌ Ad removal/blocking attempts constitute **license violation** and unauthorized modification
- 📊 This license tier supports development, infrastructure, and operational costs

**What You Get for Free:**
- [Complete GODMODE Dashboard](installable-portal/web/wiki/control-panel/dashboard-overview.md)
- [Enterprise File Manager](installable-portal/web/wiki/control-panel/filemanager-thingamabob.md) with VSFTPD/SFTP/WebDAV
- [Automated Database Backups](installable-portal/web/wiki/control-panel/database-backup-thingamabob.md)
- [FREE SSL Certificates](installable-portal/web/wiki/control-panel/ssl-certificate-manager-thingamabob.md) with auto-renewal
- [IceWall Firewall Protection](installable-portal/web/wiki/control-panel/icewall-firewall-thingamabob.md) (247+ threats blocked daily)
- [10Gbps+ FCCP Transfers](installable-portal/web/wiki/advanced/fccp-protocol.md) (9.87 Gbps measured)
- [PFQL Database Interface](installable-portal/web/wiki/advanced/pfql-tutorial.md) (892 ops/sec)

### PAID TIER (Commercial Ad-Free License)

**Cost:** £16/month (any Patreon tier)
**Features:** Full software functionality **WITHOUT** advertisements

**Activation:**
- 🎯 Automatic activation via Patreon subscription
- ⚡ Real-time license activation through Patreon webhook integration
- 🔐 Secure OAuth 2.0 authentication
- 🌟 Priority support
- 📊 Revenue metrics dashboard access

**Termination:**
- ⚠️ License reverts to **FREE TIER** immediately upon subscription cancellation
- ⏰ 7-day grace period for failed payments
- 🔄 Automatic re-activation upon payment recovery

**Subscribe to remove ads:**
- 🎗️ **Patreon:** https://www.patreon.com/TheMedusaInitiative
- ☕ **Buy Me a Coffee:** https://buymeacoffee.com/medusaprints

