## LICENSE ENFORCEMENT

**Built-In Enforcement:**
- License tier is enforced **server-side** and **cannot be bypassed**
- Ad injection is compiled into the binary and protected by license terms
- Attempting to bypass license checks constitutes **license violation**
- Reverse engineering to remove ads is **prohibited** (see RESTRICTIONS above)

**Security Measures:**
- Real-time Patreon webhook verification using HMAC-MD5 signatures
- Tamper detection for ad bypass attempts
- Audit logging of all license events
- Automatic grace period management for payment failures

**User Rights:**
- **FREE tier users:** Mandatory ad display, all features available
- **PAID tier users:** Complete ad removal, priority support
- **All users:** No redistribution, no modification, no reverse engineering

